msgid "After enabling Automatic Optimization, files will be queued and when someone visits your site, they’ll be optimized. To check if the page is optimized, you can use the inspect mode and navigate to the network tab in your console. As mentioned above, optimized files will either be served from our CDN or a local Hummingbird directory, and the file name will be hashed."
